silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_01_representability_proposition_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'RepresentabilityPropositionYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Representability Proposition', the natural_iso_arrow witnesses the natural isomorphism Hom(-,Mittens) iso ClinicalLabelPresheaf; the unique isomorphism is the representative of MittensColimitApex in the presheaf category." .
